{"id":"NCT04994756","title":"Stroke Thrombectomy and Aneurysm Registry","official":"Stroke Thrombectomy and Aneurysm Registry","summary":"This international multi-center registry is used to collect existing information and outcomes for patients undergoing an operation for treatment of injuries to the brain including the blockage of blood flow to an area of the brain, an abnormal ballooning of an artery, abnormal tangling of blood vessels, abnormal formation of blood vessels, tearing of vein, and bleeding in the brain. This information is used to help predict outcomes that undergo an operation for treatment of the above-listed brain injuries. Additionally, the information is used to compare techniques and devices' effects on technical and clinical outcomes.","conditions":["Stroke","Thromboses, Intracranial","Aneurysm, Brain"],"interventions":[{"type":"PROCEDURE","name":"Stroke/Thrombectomy/Aneurysm-specific surgical procedures"}],"criteria":"Inclusion Criteria:\n\n* Undergoing surgical intervention for central nervous system vascular lesion\n* Between 1 and 120 years of age\n\nExclusion Criteria:\n\n* No exclusion criteria","minAge":"1 Year","maxAge":"120 Years","sex":"ALL","healthy":false,"studyType":"OBSERVATIONAL","purpose":"","enrollment":40000,"start":"2019-09-17","pcd":"2055-01-01","upd":"2025-12-24","sponsor":"Medical University of South Carolina","areas":["neurology"],"central":["Alejandro M Spiotta, MD · 843-792-9226 · spiotta@musc.edu","Meredith Robinson, MS · 843-792-3164 · robme@musc.edu"],"sites":[{"f":"University of Alabama at Birmingham","city":"Birmingham","pr":"Alabama","zip":"35233","s":"R","lat":33.5207,"lon":-86.8025,"c":"Elizabeth Liptrap, MD · (205) 934-7170 · elizabethle@uabmc.edu"},{"f":"Loma Linda University","city":"Loma Linda","pr":"California","zip":"92350","s":"R","lat":34.0483,"lon":-117.2612,"c":"Justin Dye, MD · jdye@llu.edu"},{"f":"Cottage Health Research Institute","city":"Santa Barbara","pr":"California","zip":"93105","s":"R","lat":